# The mana a permanent's triggered mana ability adds when a land is tapped (CR 605.1b, 605.4a) counts towards what a
# player can pay (CR 601.2g-h), before anything is tapped. Turn 3: Utopia Sprawl (Red chosen) on Bot1's first Forest, with
# the pool empty and only that Forest untapped: Stomp ({1}{R}) is offered, and the Forest's {G} and Utopia Sprawl's {R} pay
# for it. Turn 4: Bot2 casts Mana Flare with its first Mountain and two Moxes, and then, with only its second Mountain
# untapped, its own Stomp, paid by the Mountain's {R} and Mana Flare's additional {R}.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Forest
Utopia Sprawl
Bonecrusher Giant
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mana Flare
Mountain
Bonecrusher Giant
Island x12

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
