Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Utopia Sprawl.Cast(Forest#1)
Bot1.Colors(Red)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Hand.Bonecrusher Giant.Cast(Bot2; Ability: Adventure)
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest#1.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
