Bot1.Pass
? Bot2.Mana =
Bot2.Hand.Bonecrusher Giant.Cast(Bot1; Ability: Adventure)
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain#2.Activate
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T4 Bot2.Main2]

